From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sapphire <sapphire@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0403: Metal driver fixes - HakiosMetal bundle, MSL 2.2, argument buffers

Fixes for the Metal driver (HakiosMetal, loaded via sweetmetal=2):

1. MSL 2.2 compatibility: Update shader function signatures, attribute/vertex descriptors
2. Argument buffers: Implement tier 1 argument buffers for texture/sampler binding
3. Heap/Resource memory: Fix MTLHeap creation from IOSurface (panel memory)
4. Command buffer: Fix blit/compute encoder synchronization for present path
5. MTLDevice: Register HakiosMetalDevice as the system Metal device

This patch modifies the installer bundle and adds kernel-side support for the Metal driver.

